# Interfaces & code budgets

## Conditioning vector (live pack = **5** numbers — claim Z update)
Logged / trained layout (`CONDITIONING_LAYOUT`):
| Field | Dim | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| `p_hat_x/y(t+Δ)` | 2 | Predicted object XY at action-landing time |
| `p_hat_z` | 1 | Grasp height `z_grasp` (latched; vz = 0) |
| `v_hat_x/y` | 2 | Object XY velocity |

**Height changes p̂z, never relative d_z** (`z_grasp = max(z_top−g, z_table+c)`).
Δ (look-ahead) is baked into XY p̂; claim path uses measured/reported Δ via
`claim_timing`. Legacy G1 used fixed yaml Δ and a **4**-number pack — old
checkpoints are not bit-compatible; retrain after this change.

Still dropped: `v_hat_z`, `sigma_*`, `valid`, `coast_time`.

